    "sources": "Installed costs: same model as our cost calculator (2026-11-13). Running costs: same formula as our gas vs electric tool, EIA prices. Federal credit: $0 (IRS, 25C ended 2025). <a href=\"/methodology/#heat-pump-water-heater-cost\">See our savings checked against ENERGY STAR and DOE</a>."
